The final project is intended to be a LoRa enabled mesh network of water buoys that collect various teypes of data. 
The final  buoy will integrate a SONDE water sensor measuring ph, turbidity, disolved oxygen etc. A weather sensor
that measures air tempurate, wind speed, barometric pressure, etc. As well as a tempurate string that measures the 
water tempuratre throughout the water column providing depth accurate tempurature readings.

This data is stored in a python database that is connecetd to a web app that runs in your browser through localhost.
The web app allows the user to plot the data using a heatmap and overlays the heatmap on a GPS unabled map.
